<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Swiss Reinsurance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Reinsurance registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One share is contolled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2400 CHF		  PREMIUM	24.46 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.20 CHF		  GEARING	9.57 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	16.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	07.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2105 CHF</p>
<p> NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE    SBCEDCH3</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
